E015_bare_return_in_typed.cmm:3:5: semantic error: function 'foo' must return a value of type int
  |
3 |     return;
  |     ^^^^^^
what went wrong:
  The function 'foo' promises to return a int, but 'return;' provides no
  value.
how to fix:
  Provide a value of type int with 'return <value>;'.
      return 0;
